[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
This package contains the sources of the memc module only.  It does not
install a loadable module.

The module itself is built by the nginx ports.  To use it, build www/nginx,
www/nginx-devel or www/freenginx with the MEMC option enabled.
Those ports pick the sources up from
%%PREFIX%%/share/nginx/modules/nginx-module-memc
and produce ngx_http_memc_module.so.
EOM
}
]
